cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Assay in your research, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Assay: LLM Documentation Evaluation and Drift Monitoring"
abstract: >-
  An open, reproducible harness that scores LLM-generated technical
  documentation with deterministic checks and an LLM judge, validates the score
  against blind human ratings, and monitors it for quality drift.
authors:
  - family-names: Salguero
    given-names: Carlos
    website: "https://csalguero.me"
repository-code: "https://github.com/salgue441/assay"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - llm-evaluation
  - llm-as-a-judge
  - documentation
  - drift-detection
  - calibration
  - reproducibility
